WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:00.600
[ominous music]

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:05.905
- [breathing heavily]
ALL RIGHT, LISTEN UP.

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:08.108
SHERIFF'S DEPARTMENT'S
CLOSE BY--WE'LL BE SAFE THERE.

00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:10.043
- OKAY.
- STAY CLOSE.

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:11.611
- [blows air]
- I'LL GET YOU OUT OF HERE.

00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:13.380
- [snarling]

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:14.681
all: [screaming]

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:20.186
[screaming and whimpering]

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:21.888
- OH, MY GOD!
- OH, MY GOD!

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:23.590
- THEY GOT BRAD!
- [whimpers]

00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:25.592
- THEY GOT BRAD!
THEY GOT BRAD!

00:00:25.759 --> 00:00:27.460
- HEY, THEY DIDN'T GET US!
THEY DIDN'T GET US!

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:29.229
- [whimpers]
- OKAY? WE'RE STILL ALIVE.

00:00:29.396 --> 00:00:30.997
- YEAH, RIGHT.
- KEEP IT TOGETHER.

00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:32.799
- YEAH, OKAY.
- WE GOTTA MAKE IT

00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:33.867
TO THAT SHERIFF'S STATION.
- RIGHT.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:34.501
OH, MY GOD.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:38.938
- [gasps]

00:00:44.144 --> 00:00:50.083
- [screaming]

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.852
- WE GOTTA GO THROUGH 'EM.
JUST STAY TOGETHER,

00:00:53.019 --> 00:00:54.454
KEEP MOVING,
AND DON'T GET BIT.

00:00:54.621 --> 00:00:55.088
GO!

00:00:57.824 --> 00:01:01.327
- [whimpering]

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:09.736
- ARE YOU GETTING THIS?
- YEAH, WHAT IS UP?

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:12.705
- ALL RIGHT, LET'S GO.
LET'S GO.

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:14.340
- THIS IS
SOME CRAZY [bleep].

00:01:19.279 --> 00:01:20.413
IT'S--WHAT?

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:21.648
- UM--

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:28.088
- OH.
- AIN'T THAT SOME [bleep]?

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:31.157
- THESE ARE SOME RACIST
MOTHER-[bleep] ZOMBIES!

00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:32.959
- WHY WOULD YOU EVEN
LOCK THE DOOR?

00:01:33.126 --> 00:01:34.461
I MEAN, THE WINDOW'S BROKEN,
AND--

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:35.662
- [gasps]
- OKAY.

00:01:35.829 --> 00:01:37.297
- OH! OH, HELL, NO.

00:01:37.464 --> 00:01:37.897
- THAT'S--
- NO, NO, NO.

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:42.902
OH, COME ON!

00:01:43.069 --> 00:01:44.804
- WHAT IS THAT?

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:46.406
- THEY SERIOUSLY
WOULDN'T LET HER EAT US.

00:01:46.573 --> 00:01:47.574
- THAT'S--
- HEY, GUYS.

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:49.909
ISN'T THIS GREAT?

00:01:50.076 --> 00:01:52.178
THESE RACIST ZOMBIES
ARE LEAVING US ALONE.

00:01:52.345 --> 00:01:53.480
COME ON,
WE'RE HAVING A PARTY.

00:01:57.050 --> 00:01:58.418
[funk music]

00:01:58.585 --> 00:02:00.053
- THE BEER IS HERE!

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.288
[cheering]

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:04.224
AND LOOK WHO I BROUGHT.
COME ON, MAN.

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:07.927
[cheering]

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:13.867
[ominous music]

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:18.004
♪ ♪

